{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8e883893d2e51f4c","name":"Droid Battle Station","source":{"id":"source:reference-8e883893d2e51f4c","title":"Droid Battle Station","revision":21020,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:00:28Z","sha256":"189a678994eaa1142b036f7156f1c80f9359e1dfc1b5b928d47b1822afe1a5b6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21020","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droid%20Battle%20Station&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8e883893d2e51f4c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 50,000 per 100 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 5,000 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Droid Battle Stations provide the functionality of regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Command Stations"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Command_Stations"},", and they can be used to direct ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," in combat. Droid Battle Stations are typically large installations, capable of coordinating hundreds or thousands of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," of all types. Some Droid Battle Stations emulate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Commanders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Commanders?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When the Droid Battle Station is installed, select two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Commander","referenceId":"reference:08cf853e451c4fa4"}," Prestige Class. These ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," can be used by the character operating the Droid Battle Station as if the character has those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},". The number of times each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be used is calculated per station, not per character, so switching characters in the middle of a battle does not grant additional uses. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Commander","referenceId":"reference:08cf853e451c4fa4"}," Prestige Class cannot use these ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," more often even if they duplicate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," already possesses.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
